<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Lamma LS: Ruu tɔ̃vɨng Riinɛ</book>
  <para style="h">1 Tasaloniyayi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bulus Sẽkoo au Gaa Beenɛ Yɛnɛ Shɔ Tasaloniyayi bi</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tasaloniyayi</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bulus Sẽkoo au Gaa Beenɛ yɛnɛ Shɔ Tasaloniyayi bi</para>
  <para style="imt">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Tasaloniya sipɛ tipi komoo Rooma pɛ̃niba a Makidoniya. Bulus ɓeli wɛrɛ Ɗa a ɗɔuni akɨnti gbete yaa Pilipi yɛ. Shɔ kpaa shɔgbete iji kasi viu pɛliyɛ ɓa atette Yahudawayi, i kagɨn aru nogbete ɗashari Bulus a nyawanɛ Kirisa au pɛli atette shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawayi ɓayɛ, ai kasi Yahudawayi nyaba gɨnnɛ. Shɔ tɔ̃si Bulus rɛ nɛu yaa Tasalonika nɛu yɛkɛ Beriya. Kɛ ɗaa au to Korinti yɛ, Timoti, Bulus ɓɛusa vishonɛ geliu ruu aru shɔ wɛrɛ Ɗa ai Tasalonika yɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Bulus sẽkoo au gaa beenɛ yɛnɛ shɔ Tasaloniyayi bi</char> beerɛ aru u masiyibii, u laki Kirisayi kaka a ɗɔuni. Bulus dɔ̃rirɛ aru gbete shɔ geliuyɛ ai ruu sisɨn ãnɛ a ɔrinɛ; a kpaariyi sisɨnrɛ aru ɔ̃nɛ au ɔ̃si ayiniyɛ, kɛɗɔn a kasinya ruu hɨlinɛ a shɔ hɨn a wɛrɛ Ɗa aru Kirisi sɔɔnɛ: Shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ au kɛ vɔnɛ a ɗaa e Kirisi ji sɔɔ ɓayɛ, yɛ kpaa kati atette suru au yisinya ɓa a Kirisi sɔɔnɛ yɛ n-tiyɛni ya? I hɨn sɔ̃nɛ Kirisi yɛ sɔɔ kɛpɛ ɗaviya? Bulus geliyirɛ nɛi yɛ ɗekɨn ai vishonɛni ɓatata i ɗɔ ganɛ atette sisɨn ãnɛ aru Kirisi sɔɔnɛ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au Ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yutasinɛ (1.1)</para>
  <para style="io1">Dɔ̃rinɛ a bɛlinɛ (1.2-3.13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bimasinɛ a Kirisa vishonɛ (4.1-12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyakosinɛ aru Kirisi sɔɔnɛ (4.13-5.11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bimasinɛ au wasinaa (5.12-22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yisinɛ (5.23-28)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Sẽkoom shɛ au naa Bulus, Sila a Timotini u ɓasitɛ u gee wɔ nyatɛ kpai</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Yɛnɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Tasalonika i ɗɔbii, shɔ gbeteyi pɛ Ɗalapa Uɓeye a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi ɓɛɛyɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Mɛnɛ Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛni u ɔ̃ ɓɛɛkɔ.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Tasaloyayi Ɔ̃nɛ a Sisɨn Ãnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Kopiɗaviya u dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa tɔ awɔ yuuni kpai, u ɓawɔ niitɔ kopiɗaviya au Ɗa gakinɛni. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />U kpaa sisɨntɔ a Ɗalapa a Uɓeye ɗekɨn nɔgbete ɔ tasi ɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a yɛti vishonɛni, a nɔgbete ɔ zɔ ɔrinɛ pɔ̃rɛ ɔ pɛli vishonɛ fɛ̃ɛm, anɔgbete ɔ pɔ̃ sisɨn a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi bi u kaka ɗɔn. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />U shɔbiiyi u zɛtɛttɔ Ɗalapa ɔrɔɔtɔ, lɔwɔtɛ ɔ ɔ̃ u ɓɛɛ. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Aruviya u n-tɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn ɓa nyashanɛkɔ sheeli ɓa, ama wɔsɔ̃n Ɗa suru vishonɛrɛ au kakani, wɔsɔ̃n a sisɨn ãnɛ aru vitɔ̃vɨng au zɛtɛttɔyɛ. Ɔ zɛu ɔ̃nɛ tɛttɔ aɗagbete u si a ɔkɔɔniyɛ; si ji awɔ yuukɔ. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Ɔ mɛsiutɔ a Uɓeyelapani, anɔgbete ɔ ɓooraani kpai, ɔ tɛ Ɗanyarubiitɔ a sisɨn puru au shɛ a Ɗa suru ɗɔbiiyɛ. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Aru nankɔ ɔ ɔ̃kɛ vitasinɛ a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi ɗɔbii kpai shɔgbeteyi a Makadɔniya a shɔ Akayayi ni. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Aru si jo awɔ yuukɔ shɔ nta Uɓeyelapa ruubiirɛ ɓanɛ a Makadoniya a Akaya kɔ sheeli ɓa, ama ruu gbete awɔ ruu sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗalapa bi raaɗɔ kpai. U vi shanɛwɔ tɔkɨn ɓa. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Shɔ kpai shɔ nwanyatɔ awɔ yuuni nɔgbete ɔ tɛunaa aɗagbete u awɔ ɗɔbiiyɛ, a nɔgbete ɔ yaa jaɗayi bassinɛ awɔ gaakɛ Ɗalapa gbete u suru ɗɔnyɛ nizɛ bassinɛ, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />ɔ gakɛ u ɓɛɛ jaa anɛ a kolapa, u ɓɛɛ jaa Yesɔ, shɔgbete yuu a saa yɛ, shɔu raau a Ɗalapa yɛti lɛsinɛ gbete kaanɛyɛ.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Bulus Vishonɛ a Tasalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />U shɔbiiyi ɔ awɔ yuu ɔ zɛtɛttɔ nɛ u anɛ ɔ ɗɔbii siɓa nɛu niitɔ ɓa. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />U ɓɛɛ anɛ awɔ ɗɔbii a Tasaloniya ɔ zɛ nɔgbete shɔ tasiu raa tɛttɔ a dãnɛ ni a komoo pɛ̃niba Filipi. piti nɔgbete u shɔnɔpɔ̃yi i si ɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm ni , u Ɗalapa masiubii nɛu gelɔɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete shɛ au ɗɔbiiyɛtɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Ɗanyaruubi au nwarɔɔ si ɓanɛ u niitɔ ɓa ko a sisɨn gbɔrki ɓa, ɓanɛ u kasi nɛu ɗaki shɔwɔ ɓa. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Anɔgbete u si pɛlinam, kopiɗaviya u sha ɓɛɛ jo vigbete Ɗalapa kasi nɛu shayɛ, aruviya yeeruu tɛttɔ au yuuni nɛu yɛ nɔgbete shɔ ãu ruu tɔ̃vɨn nwanɛ a naayɛtɛ. Ɓanɛ u kasinɛ shɔu nta binyatɔ̃nɛ ɓa, ama u kasirɛ Ɗalapa u ntabiinyatɔ̃nɛrɛ, shɔgbeteu ntau visisɨntɔ kopiɗaviya. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Ɔ zɛtɛttɔ fɛ̃ɛm nɛ u ji awɔ ɗɔbii ɓa a nya shɔ̃tinɛ ɓa, sɔ̃n ɓanɛ u pɛli vishonɛ au ruu nwanɛ u kukiu gbɔgbɔrɛ ɓa, Ɗalapa ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ u shɔshikɨntinɛ! <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />ɓanɛ u kã bɛlinɛ a kopiya ɗɔbii ɓa, ko awɔ ɗɔbii ko a shɔwɔyi ɗɔbii, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Nɔgbete u Kirisi jashonɛ u si kã viwɔtɛ awɔ naani ama aɗagbete u si a ɔkɔɔniyɛ u si shɔ yuuroorinɛ, naa jaa ɓini kɔu jaayiyɛ, <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Aru u ɔrinɛ gbete u ɔrɔɔyɛ, u mabii tɛttɔ ɓanɛ u nwarɔɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn au shɛ Ɗalapa ɗɔbiikɔ sheeli ɓa ama ko u suru u ãtɔ awɔ yuuni. Aruviya ɔ tou sisɨn tɛttɔ fɛ̃ɛm! <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Pɛ nizɛ, ɔ kpaa sisɨn tɛttɔ n shɔbiiyi, nɔgbete u shovishonɛ au ɓooraaniǃ U pɛli vishonɛ a ɔkɔɔni zɨmba a niti ni nɔgbete u yɛ ɔ̃rɔɔ yukɔnɛ wɔ ɓa aɗagbete ukɛ nwarɔɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn nɛ au shɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbiiyɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Ɔkɔɔ ɔ̃rɛ u shɔ shinɛkɨntiyi, Ɗalapa pɛ jo nankɔ, u ruubii gbete u tasɔɔ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi si pɛ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ, tɔ̃vɨn, ruuvini ɓa ɗɔnniɓa. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Ɔ zɛtɛttɔ u kɔ wɔ naa jaa ɓeye a ɓini i kɔyi ɓɛɛ jaayiyɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />U masɔɔbiitɔ, u sɔ̃nrɔɔmurutɔ u yɛ ɗekɨn awɔ gakinɛni ɔ ɔ̃ zɔ̃n ɔ̃nɛ gbete Ɗalapa ntabiinyatɔ̃nɛ a ɔkɔɔni, shɔgbete ɓawɔ nyanɛ ɔ kpaa ɔ̃nɛ awuni au ɗɔ kpati roonɛ a bassinɛni.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Aruumkɔ u dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa tɔ kopiɗaviya. Naa ɔkɛ weshonɛ Ɗanyaruubiinɛ gbete u n-tɔyɛni, ɔ tɛrɛ ɓa naa shɔzɛ ruu-nwanɛ ɓa ama ɔ tɛrɛ nɛ pɛ Ɗalapa nyanwanɛ, pɛ jo nankɔ. Ɔ shɔgbete ɔ ãsisinyɛ Ɗalapa u ɗɔgbeteu shovishonɛ awɔ sisɨnni. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />U shɔbiiyi, vigbete au pɛli ɓa a ɔkɔɔnim, pɛli sɔ̃njo namkɔ a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ gbeteyi a tipi Yahudiyani, a shɔ gbeteyi pɛ Kirisi Yesɔ ɓɛɛyɛ. Ɔ ɓoo ji raa gbetenkɔ piti a mɛshɔzɛyi naa, ayi ɓoo a Yahudawayi naa, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />yahudawayi gbeteyi nyo Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ a janyagadiyini, ai tasiu raayɛ. Ɗalapa ji ntatɔ̃vɨng ɓa a ikɔyini ɓa, aruviya i ɔ̃ nɔpɔ̃ a kopiyani. <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />I kã nɛi zãriu shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa ruu tɔ̃vɨn nwarinɛtɔ au yɛ n-tiyi raanɛyɛ. Ji nyabankɔ i yɛ ɗekɨn a ruuvini pɛlinɛni yɛnɛ lee gbete Ɗalapa yɛ tasiyi raayɛ. Dɔdɔrim Ɗalapa sisɨn lɛsinɛ nɔtɛ ai yuuǃ<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus kasirɛ nɛn ɗeyi Shɔ Tasalonika Sɔ̃ntɔt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Au bi n shɔbiiyi, naa shɔkɛ vɔsiunɛ a ɔkɔɔni sekaa, vɔsinɛ a bi ɓa sisɨn ɓa, nɔgbete ɔ yaauyɛ a nɔgbete u nwayuu fɛ̃ɛm n-tɛ u kasɔɔ zɛnɛ sɔ̃nyɛ! <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />U kasirɛ u sɔwɔ ɗɔbiitɔ. N ang yuu n kasirɛ n sɔwɔ ɗɔbii ɓako-ɓako, ama japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ ji yau ɓa. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Akɨntini kpai ɔkɔɔ pɔ̃u sisɨn pɔ̃nɛrɛ, ɓa shɔwɔyi ɓa, ɔkɔɔ pɔ̃u sisɨn puru ntanɛrɛ, ɔkɔɔ ɔ̃rɛ vigbete au sɨu baasinɛ ayuu vigbete Ɗashaariuyɛ a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ ɗekɨn naa kaanɛyɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Pɛ nizɛ kɔ, ɔkɔɔ ɔ̃rɛ vigbeteu sɨu baasinɛ a sisɨn puru ntanɛni!<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />U nyayisinɛ, u zɛrɛ u yɛ masisɨn dɔɔtɔɓa u shirɛ ɓa. Aruukɔ u lɔrɛ n-tɛ u ɔ̃ a Atina au nɔɔ. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />U sho Timotirɛ, u ɓɛzɔ̃ shɔgbete au shoshi Ɗalapa vishonɛ a ukɔɔni a nyaba ruu tɔ̃vɨn nwanɛ a Kirisi yuu. U shourɛ u lakɔbii, u pɔ̃sɔɔnaa a nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />aru nɔgbete shɔwɔ yɛ sɔɔ knti ɓa aru raatasinɛm ɓa. Ɔ zɛtɛttɔ awɔ yuuni nɛ, u yɛ ɓooraa nankɔ aruviya pɛ Ɗalapa kasirɛ nɛu ɔ̃ nankɔ. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Aruviya aɗagbete u si awɔ ɗɔbiiyɛ, u gelɔɔ si tɛtɔ n-tɛ ɔ yɛ ɓooraatɔ; nagbete ɔ zɛtɛtɔ fɛ̃ɛmkɔ, ji vigbete au shau ji ukɔ pɛlirɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Aruukɔ n zɛ naa n shi dɔɔtɔɓa, n sho Timoti kn. N shourɛ u hɨrɔpɛ awɔ ruu sisɨn ãnɛni. Seti pɛlintɔ n-tɛ wɔɓa shɔ-shɔ ɗakinɛ ɗakawɔmtɛ aruviya u vishonɛ yɛ ɔ̃rɛ wati weze!<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Dɔdɔrim Timoti sɔɔ atɛ, n-tiu ruu tɔ̃vɨntɛ aru ɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a zɔ ɔrinɛ ni. Geliutɛ nɛ ɔ lɛritɔ tɔ̃vɨn au yuuni kopiɗaviya, ɔ kasiu zɛnɛtɔ fɛ̃ɛm nagbete u kasɔɔ zɛnɛ sɔ̃njiyɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Aru nankɔ, n shɔbiiyi, au yuyɔrinɛ a raaɓoonɛni piti kpai shɔ masiubii tɛttɔ awɔ yuuni. Si jo ɔ sisɨn ãnɛkɔ masiu birɛ, <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />aruviya dɔdɔrim u yɛ ɔ̃ dɔɔtɔ ɔkɛ shinɛdɔkaziti aka yuɓasinɛ a Uɓeyelapani. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Dɔdɔrim u dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa dɔɔɓa awɔ yuuni ɓa. U dɔ̃uritɛ fɛ̃ɛm a sisɨn puru gbete ɔ n-tiu ɓa a ɗekɨn mini. <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Zɨmba a niti ni u ɗɔgbete u gaki Ɗa awɔ yuu u zɛwɔ sɔ̃ntɔ, u ãwɔ vigbete ɔ ɓa awuni ɓa awɔ tete sisɨn ãnɛ.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Mɛnɛ u Ɗalapa u ɓeye au yuu, a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ u pɛliu nyaba ɔ ɗɔbii anɛtɔ! <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Mɛnɛ Uɓeyelapa u pɛlɔɔ nyaba zɔ ɔrinɛ a shɔni piti kpaitɔ, u barɛ u yɛ ɗekɨnɗekɨn u ɔ̃kɛ pɛ̃niba nagbete u ɔrɔɔyɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Jo a nyabankɔ yɛ lakɔɔbiirɛ, ɔ yɛ ɔ̃kɛ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ a wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ au Ɗalapa ɗekɨn a ɓeyeni, aɗagbete Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ kaanɛ a shɔgbeteyi pɛ u ɓɛɛyini.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nɛ Gbete Ɗalapa Ntabiinyatɔ̃nɛ Awuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />U nyayisinɛ u shɔbiiyi ɔ mati tɛttɔ au bi nɔgbete ɔ ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ gbete Ɗalapa ntabiinyatɔ̃nɛ a wuniyɛ. Shom pɛ nizɛ, ji naa gbete ɔ ɔ̃ ɓankɔ. Dɔdɔrim u gakɔɔtɔ u masɔɔbii a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ nii ɔ pɛlirɛ u tɛɛ shɔmtɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Aruviya aka Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ kaka ɔ zɛ nyakɔsinɛ gbete u kɔsɔɔyɛ tɛttɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Ɗalapa kasinɛ ɔkɔɔ pɛli kpangtannɛ ko fɛ̃ɛ̃, ɔ ɔ̃ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ kpai. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Ɔ vɔshɔyi kopiya u mati nɔgbete yɛ ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ yuu sãnɛ a mɛsoni a nyaba bassinɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />ɓa ɔrinɛ kɔ̃linɛ gbete shɔ kasi roonɛ a zɔni ɓa, naa shɔ gbete i ji ãsisɨn ɓa Ɗalapa biini ɓayɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Arumkɔ shɔwɔkɔ pɛli u shɔbii vikɔ̃linɛ nɛ ko ukɔ kuli u shɔbii i nɔnɛ. U gelɔɔ si tɛttɔ, U gɔ̃wɔ yusho a kakani shɔ gbete kɛ pɛlinɛ Uɓeyelapa yɛ tasiyi raatɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Ɗalapa ji ɓaunya ɓa nɛu ɔ̃ a ɓuzɨn kpantang pɛlinɛ ɓa ama kasi nɛu ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Aru nankɔ shɔgbeteu kɛ bɛ̃ɛ̃ vimatinɛm nɛ ji bɛ̃ɛ̃ ɓa shɔzɛ ɓɛɛ ɓa ama bɛ̃ɛ̃ pɛ Ɗalapa ɓɛɛ, shɔ gbete ãu Ɗa suruyɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Aru zɔ ɔrinɛ dɔdɔrim ji tɔ̃ɓa u beerɔɔ vi a yuuni ɓa ɔ awɔ yuu Ɗalapa matɔ tɛttɔ nɛ ɔ ɔri zɔtɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Ji nankɔ ɔ ɔri shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi tɛ kpai a Makidoniyani. Arumi nankɔ u gakɔɔtɔ u shɔbiiyi, ɔ pɛlirɛ u tɛɛ shomtɔ <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Ɔ mabii ɔ ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ gbete yɛ tasi shɔwɔyi raa ɓayɛ, ɔ kɔjo ɔ vipɛlinɛ sheeli, gbete ɔ kpaa vishaanɛ gbete ɔ shaayɛ, ji nagbete u gelɔɔ siyɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />A nyabang kɔ shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn ɓayɛ i yɛ basɔɔtɔ, ɔ yɛ debii ɓa shɔwɔ biini ɓa aru vigbete ɔ kasiyɛni ɓa.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uɓeyelapa Anɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />U shɔbiiyi u kasirɛ ɔ zɛ ruu tɔ̃vɨntɔ aru shɔ gbeteyi vɔtɛyɛ, nɔgbete ɔ sisɨn yɛ lɛsi ɓa, ɓa naa shɔgbeteyi sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ ɓayɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />U ãsisɨn tɛttɔ nɛ Yesɔ vɔrɛ a yulapa sɔ̃nrɛ a saa, aru nankɔ u ãsisɨntɛ nɛ Yesɔ kɛ sɔɔ kotipi nɛ Ɗalapa yɛ yusi shɔgbeteyi vɔlitɛ ai ãsisɨn au bi u ɗɔbiitɔ.<verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Vigbete u matɔɔ dɔdɔrim pɛ Uɓeyelapa vimatinɛː U shɔ gbeteu a suruni dɔdɔrim a lee gbete Uɓeyelapa yɛ sɔɔyɛ, u yɛ yɛɓa a ɗekɨn u yaa shɔgbeteyi vɔlitɛttɔyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Pɛ ji Uɓeyelapa au yuu yɛ nɔrɛ a kolapa yɛ ãsinya a kakani, shɔ yɛ nta yupɛ̃ni Ɗajashonɛlapa yeenya, a Ɗalapa gãnti geenɛni. Shɔ gbeteyi vɔliyɛ ai ãsisɨn a Kirisi bii shɔyɛ yusilapa shɔnɛ pɛ ikɔyi a suru ni; <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Kɛɗɔn u shɔ gbete u yɛ ɔ̃ a suru ni a ɗauni, u yɛ tolinya a yini a sabu u kpaa Uɓeyelapa a konyasi. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Aru nankɔ ɔ masi zɔ bitɔ a ruumni.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ mabiitɔ Aru Uɓeyelapa A nɛni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Ama aru lee aɗagbete vim yɛ pɛliyɛ n shɔbiiyi ji kɔri ɓa n beerɔɔ rɛ n gelɔɔtɔ ɓa. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Aruviya ɔ awɔ yuu ɔ zɛtɛttɔ fɛ̃ɛm nɛ Uɓeyelapa lee anɛ yɛ ɔ̃ naa ɓɔɔ a yɛ a zɨmba. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Aɗagbete shɔ kɛ shanɛ nɛ&lt;&lt;U ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ aɗɔn a ɔ̃nɛbiitɔ̃vɨngni,&gt;&gt;Kɛɗɔn a ɗaukɔ i yɛ zɛ vilɛsinɛ pɛ̃niba gbete yɛ kpaayiyɛrɛǃ Yɛ a naa jaakɔnɛ gbete kɔ su gbete yee jaayɛ ɓayi zɛnɛni ɓa, shɔwɔ yɛ ranaa ɓa. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Ama n shɔbiiyi ɔ ,ɓa ɗɔkɨnri ɓa, leeu ukɔ wisɔɔnɛbii naa ɓɔɔyi a yɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Ɔ piti kpai ɔ pɛ shɔgbeteyi ɗɔsẽsẽ, shɔgbeteyi ɗɔ niti yɛ, u ɓa shɔgbeteyi ɗɔ zɨmba ko shɔgbeteyi ɗɔkɨnri ɓa. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Aru nankɔ Ukɔu roonɔroonɛ naa shɔwɔyini; ama u ɔ̃ a nɔkãkãri atette bimanɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Aruviya shɔgbeteyi roonoroo i roo a zɨmba, shɔgbete visiiyɛ siyi a zɨmba. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Ama u pɛ shɔ ɗɔ niti, u pɛli ji vigbete tɔ̃vɨn, u hã sisɨn ãnɛ a ɔrinɛ ni au nɔsisɨn naa fãrã saka, u hã waayu sɨntanɛ au yuu u ɔ̃ u sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ aru raanɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Ɗalapa ji lɔu ɓa nɛu ɓooraa aru u sisɨn lɛsinɛ ɓa ama u kpaa raanɛ aka Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi, <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Shɔgbete vɔ au yuu nɔgbete u ɔ̃ a nyazɔ awuni, ko u a suru ni ko u vɔtɛ u ɔ̃ nyazɔ awuni nɗa kaanɛyɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Aru nankɔ ɔ masi zɔ bitɔ ɔ pɔ̃si zɔ naatɔ, ji nagbete ɔ ɗɔ pɛlinɛ dɔdɔrim yɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyayeenɛ Dangdang a Nyakɔsinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />U shɔbiiyi u gakɔɔtɔ ɔ bassi shɔgbeteyi pɛli vishonɛ awɔ teteniyɛtɔ, shɔgbeteyi teesɔɔ ɗekɨn i kɔsɔɔnya awɔ ɔ̃nɛ sisɨn ãnɛyɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Ɔ basiyitɔ fɛ̃ɛm ɔ ɔriyitɔ aru vishonɛ gbeteyi pɛliyɛ. Ɔ ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ a zɔni.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />U shɔbii u ɗɔu masɔɔbii, ɔ gɔ̃ shɔ yɔkiyi yushotɔ, ɔ masi shɔgbeteyi sisɨn vɔtɛ bitɔ, ɔ pɔ̃si shɔgbeteyi kaka ɓa naatɔ, ɔ mɛɛsisɨntɔ a kopiyani. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Ɔ kɔyuutɔ shɔwɔ ukɔ kɔsinɔɔ vikɔ̃linɛ a vikɔ̃linɛni, ama kopiɗaviya ɔ pɛlɔɔ yuu vitɔ̃vɨng a kopiyani.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Kopiɗaviya ɔ ɔ̃ a sisɨn puru. <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Ɔ gaki Ɗatɔ kopiɗaviya, <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ Ɗa dɔ̃rinɛ a vigbete ɔ kpawɔ yuu a ɗɔnyɛni kpai, shom pɛ vigbete Ɗalapa kasi awɔ ɔ̃nɛ awɔ yuɓasinɛ a Kirisi Yesɔni.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Ɔkɔɔ zãri Ɗa suru vishonɛ pɛlinɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Ɔkɔɔ bɛ̃ɛ̃ janyagadiyi nyanwanɛ nɛ, <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />ɔ nta ko-iviyapɛtɔ kpai: ɔ sã vigbete tɔ̃vɨntɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Ɔ yaa vikɔ̃linɛ ko-pi shɔpiya pɛlinɛtɔ.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Mɛnɛ Ɗalapa shɔgbeteu ãu ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ u pɔ̃ ɔrɛ ɔ ɔ̃ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ko-pi nyaba shɔpiya, mɛnɛu sãwɔ surubiitɔ, awɔ suruni, ruuvini ukɔ ɗii ɔ binɛ ãnɛ lee gbete Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi yɛ a yɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Shɔgbeteu ɓawɔnyayɛ yɛ pɛlitɔ aruviya u shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />N shɔbiiyi ɔ gakiu Ɗa jo.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Ɔ gee shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ nyatɔ kpai a nyageenɛ zɔ naa kɔ̃tinɛbii shɔ ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />N gakɔɔtɔ a Uɓeyelapa nii ɔ ɓali shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi sẽkoomtɔ piti kpai.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔɔni piti.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>